        "note_tweet": {
          "entities": {},
          "text": "Funny you say that, because there’s a thing called “Broken Arm Syndrome”. So yes, kind of. They’ll say we need to stop our meds.\n\nOne time I went in with Covid like symptoms. I told them I thought it was Covid and wanted to be tested. When the nurse practitioner found out I was trans, she told me that she didn’t think I had Covid, and that breast implants had side effects like this sometimes. That was her diagnosis. I said I wanted to do the test anyway…and I tested positive for Covid."
        },
